lor:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; com=
p-&gt;rstate =3D kzalloc(rsize, GFP_KERNEL);<o:p></o:p></span></p>
