=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;co=
lor:black">If you pass the appropriate parameters, make sure tslots and rsl=
ots two parameters are greater than 255. This lead comp-&gt;rstate
 equal NULL.In cases no check the comp-&gt;rstate is NULL, using it in kern=
el casue the system crash and restart.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" align=3D"left" style=3D"text-align:left"><span lang=
