|=3D------------------------[ #5 File 0x03 ]-------------------------=3D|
|=3D-----------------------------------------------------------------=3D|
|=3D-------=3D[ CVE-2015-8088: Heap Overflow Vulnerability ]=3D----------=
=3D|=20=20
|=3D--------=3D[ in the HIFI Driver of Huawei Smart Phone ]=3D-----------=
=3D|
|=3D-----------------------------------------------------------------=3D|
|=3D-----------------------=3D[ By Pray3r   ]=3D-------------------------=
