/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/commit/?h=3Dv6.3-rc2&id=3D1e641743f055=
f075ed9a4edd75f1fb1e05669ddc), as of 2008 only Heirloom mailx (a.k.a. nail)=
 used it for ~h interactive header editing.

Best regards,

Eric




